# mutgap_svc_texture_past_end: A normal texture (type 2, 4x4 RGBA8Unorm) whose guest pages are VA page 16 of a task whose length is 16 pages, where the page table still has a valid leaf. Paging it in makes a transfer buffer over those pages, whose mapping refuses a range past the task's end ("Address (...) out of range for task"), so the exec that copies the texture into a shared buffer faults and the buffer stays zero. A later exec on the task still runs: the service lives. Isolate only: the in-process tasks page textures through their own mapping, which the tasks scenarios lock.
